      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Physics observations, not the app solver\nObserved electrical Wh uses timestamp-aligned voltage/current pairs and actual elapsed time, refusing gaps over 120 seconds and non-Drive transitions. Coverage may be partial; do not compare it with full session totals. Aero is a separate illustrative model (CdA 0.575 m², air density 1.225 kg/m³), not the configured app solver. Rolling, grade and the full unexplained residual are available only in the app. Session average-power products are not independent measurements."
      },
      "targets": [],
      "title": "Honesty — ledger residuals",
      "transparent": true,
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "postgres",
        "uid": "DS_TESLASYNC_POSTGRESQL"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "fixedColor": "blue",
            "mode": "fixed"
